WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.567
The bajaj ride

2
00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:10.433
The bajaj takes children to school. More children get in at each stop.

3
00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.233
Three children are inside.

4
00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:15.933
Two more get in.

5
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:19.233
Start at three and count on: four, five.

6
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:22.933
Three plus two equals five.
